            <div xml:id="d959">

                <pb facs="1031" n="1019" sameAs="frus:frus1945v04/pg1019"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 Control (Italy)/8–1345: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Kirk</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rome</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-08-13T19:00:00+02:00">August 13, 1945—7
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received August 13—3:40 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2329. My 2159, July 31. I would appreciate an expression of the Dept’s views
                    regarding the maintenance of AMG (Allied Military Government) in Bolzano
                    Province until its final disposition. This question is being discussed in the
                    Allied Commission at present time and I need guidance.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Kirk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
